  "details": "> These strings need to merge:\n\n- Not available in this platform\n\n25565\n\n35400\n\n- Allow Override With \"Show Avatar\"\n\n22493\n\n23179\n\n- Groups/GROUPS\n\n22779\n\n22143\n\n- Bio/BIO\n\n22667\n\n22745\n\n- Unblock/ Unblock{ln}\n\n23917\n\n22801 \n\n- Update your status\n\n35396\n\n14447\n\n> Also, just in case, don't merge these strings:\n\n- I noticed there are some Yes/YES/No/NO exist in crowdin. Some of them belongs to VRCat. I suggest to keep all VRCat strings and don't merge them (flexibility for localization).Also, It's okay to keep ALL these differences, so don't merge.\n\n15131\t\tYes   (Login)\n\n22599\t\tYES  (General)\n\n22279              Yes! (VRCat)                       \n\n15097\t\tNo   (Login)\n\n22601\t\tNO  (General)\n\n22281              No!  (VRCat)",
